  "statement": "If the sequence \\(\\{a_n\\}\\) is defined by \\[ \\begin{aligned} a_1&=2,\\\\ a_{n+1}&=a_n+2n\\quad(n\\ge1), \\end{aligned} \\] then \\(a_{100}\\) equals",
