    {
      "id": "sol.ahsme-1984-p12.live",
      "kind": "proof-sketch",
      "text": "Telescoping the recurrence gives \\[ \\begin{aligned} a_{100} &=a_1+2\\sum_{n=1}^{99}n\\\\ &=2+2\\cdot\\frac{99\\cdot100}{2}\\\\ &=9902. \\end{aligned} \\] Therefore, the correct answer is B.",
      "hints": [
        "Add all increments from \\(a_1\\) through \\(a_{100}\\)",
        "Use \\(a_{100}=2+2(1+2+\\cdots+99)\\)"
